# Task 149-014: Connector Pool + Parallel Dispatch

## Approach
1. Create `src/connectors/connector-pool.ts` — ConnectorPool class with:
   - register(connector) — Map-based registration
   - broadcast(msg, targets) — Promise.all parallel dispatch with per-connector error isolation
   - startAll(configs) — sequential start with error logging
   - stopAll() — parallel stop
   - onAnyMessage(handler) — fan-out handler to all connectors
   - get(id), getAll(), has(id) — accessor methods

2. Create `tests/connectors/connector-pool.test.ts` — 6+ tests:
   - Register + broadcast parallel
   - Partial failure (1 of 3 fails) → other 2 succeed
   - Not-registered connector → skip with error
   - startAll + stopAll lifecycle
   - onAnyMessage fans out to all
   - Empty targets → empty result

## Files
- NEW: src/connectors/connector-pool.ts (~150 LoC)
- NEW: tests/connectors/connector-pool.test.ts (~200 LoC)

## Verify
- tsc --noEmit
- npx vitest run tests/connectors/connector-pool.test.ts
